777	
778	### Testing
779	
780	In the `example/op_demo` directory, there are multiple operator call demos that do not depend on a test framework and can run immediately after build. After developing an operator, you can write test cases to test its functionality. For details about how to write test cases, check [this guide](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/CANNCommunityEdition/850alpha001/acce/ascendtb/ascendtb_0046.html).
781	Create the `example/op_demo/addcustom` folder. The directory structure of the operator call sample is as follows:
782	
